# HOARDINGS360 — PROJECT RULES

## PRODUCT

HOARDINGS360 is an operating system and marketplace for India's outdoor advertising / OOH industry.

The core product concept is:

> THE BOARD IS THE CORE ASSET.

A physical advertising structure is represented by a BOARD.

A board contains one or more independently sellable FACES.

Never treat a board as a single sellable inventory unit.

Hierarchy:

Organization
→ Board
→ Face
→ Compliance
→ Documents
→ Occupancy
→ Enquiries/Campaigns
→ Field Jobs
→ Proof

